  "question": {
    "text": "If the locus of the image of the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> in the line mirror <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> (where <math><mi>λ</mi></math> is a parameter) is <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> where <math><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "0.6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/e8ae1cd8-0395-4bd2-ac6f-6d6102de1548.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.71389in;height:1.69375in\" /></p><p>Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;be the image of the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;about the line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Put the value of <math><mi>&#955;</mi></math> from <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> in <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br />Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> and <math><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
